  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development and Integration Program of the Salto Grande Region</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Desarrollo e Integracin de la Regin de Salto Grande</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del programa es contribuir al aumento de la competitividad de los sectoresproductivos y servicios tursticos de la Regin de Salto Grande. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) aumentar la productividadde los sectores productivos que participan del programa; (ii) mejorar el posicionamiento de la Regin de Salto Grandecomo destino turstico; y (iii) mejorar la conectividad de la Regin de Salto Grande para que contribuya a atraer mayorcantidad de turistas nacionales e internacionales</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program objective is to contribute to greater competitiveness of the productive sectors and tourism services in the Salto Grande region. The specific objectives are: (i) to raise the productivity of the productive sectors participating in the program, (ii) to better position the Salto Grande region as a tourist destination, and(iii) to improve the connectivity of the Salto Grande region, so that it can attract larger numbers of domestic and foreign tourists.</narrative>
  </description>
